5/65396729_1225052078868354_6945820870147360559_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=veJj1_lsJpoQ7kNvwH7fngv&_nc_oc=AdoBgwcMt_RJav5mnjrYXCJTwpZgvedp8gz0Vvvu0H-uH5EwReE_vReg10GbF-x3_to&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4xDnejS-ClQFQh0m85I6ZOKdxZV9YspQSbEr40e92S5Q&oe=6A08751E"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "975198817093493", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566693_975198820426826_7097624739394196541_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3NfGRTuuTXAQ7kNvwG_Uy99&_nc_oc=Ado3UNJoYdZeOQyliYp_lFFxyxl61E3jRjO6YA1IDx72189bE0-cRi2OpHdX5GSBLO0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7Aj6vv_eMT9GEciWRPiXrVYX8_qQhf5oqkAWU22Ebpww&oe=6A0876CC"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "415893571368646", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001715_415893574701979_3461447245540982035_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rjtASRjsOxYQ7kNvwGYwr6m&_nc_oc=AdqgAz4uHVGsQ6IyMIKpryTdYOfgNAoZyVMlwjXfpFdtIq64FmG8xy3mDzYVTmxW18I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af61TClum2xchvCBFy9wwGmudlOI3Wp3rSkg7lZ3RSu-3A&oe=6A089216"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "662596896051796", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_662596899385129_8527079563659693432_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BJ0Vo3xw92YQ7kNvwFWmU9-&_nc_oc=AdqGBR3-lHzE7_YEaUGV-fsG9PlD_Fyf8CcW8zmEm1QENAFfTdiN7uVGCnpDzVRZMos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6OQTs04ULYPS-Bo5QLMA2SyQbii_2nL6t0KOqxVS3gmA&oe=6A089094"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "gameplayVR3.png", "id": "492345567046352", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974804_492345570379685_6511341930176300148_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sNy_yXZTn9MQ7kNvwEzWyZL&_nc_oc=AdrKuKjfagp6RkIpDntbcWqaedGessVOuTlzlRykDjS7WPyMUjX_SGzW5-FRu4S5cVc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7_IHSusLlBCopXiOwbDacLQ-nw4voKEce0i36u00TW6w&oe=6A0863AD"}, "display_name": "Escape Simulator", "keywords": ["escape", "room", "coop", "multiplayer", "simulator"], "long_description": "Escape Simulator is a first-person puzzler you can **play solo or in an online co-op** (best with 2-3 players, but playable with up to 8!). Explore a growing set of **highly interactive escape rooms**. Pick up and examine everything, break objects, solve locks, and decipher puzzles to escape! After finishing the main game, watch for free content updates and explore rooms **built by our awesome community**.\n\n# \u2b50**REVIEWS** \n\"What I've seen has left me considerably impressed.\" - UploadVR\n\n# \u2692\ufe0f**COMMUNITY-MADE ROOMS**\nAfter finishing the main game **explore numerous rooms** built by our amazing community.\n\n# \ud83e\udd1d**ONLINE CO-OP**\nAll rooms are playable in an online co-op. Play with up to 8 players (best played with 2-3). Customize your character and join friends to solve puzzles together. More heads are better than one!\n\n# \ud83e\udde9**INTERACTIVE PUZZLES**\nExplore 28+ official rooms filled with puzzles designed by real-life escape room operators. If it\u2019s not nailed down, you can pick it up.\n\n# \ud83d\udd0d**EXEMINE EVERYTHING**\nRead books, examine ancient artifacts, and find clues to riddles. Need to cross-reference a clue? No problem - just pin it!\n\n# \ud83c\udfc6**WANT MORE?**\nThe game features additional content in the form of Addons with 4 large rooms each: \n- **Steampunk**: Solve four new rooms on the beautiful steampunk airship \"Valor.\"\n- **Wild West**: Become an outlaw in the Wild West.\n- **Magic**: Embrace your magic potential, and follow in the footsteps of great witches and wizards. \n\n", "short_description": "First-person puzzler you can play solo or in an online co-op. Explore a set of highly interactive escape rooms. Move furniture, pick up and examine everything, smash pots and break 